{"conversation_id":"fd44c34c-80c0-4d4e-8402-e8423c0f3a46","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I am waiting for the verification suite execution to finish.The verification suite (`npm test`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run smoke-test`) has completed execution. Let's inspect git status, stage the changes, and create the commit.\n\nLet's check `git status`.\n### Test Summary\n\n- **Vitest Suite**: **84 passed / 84 total** (9 test files, 0 failed, 100% green)\n- **TypeScript Typecheck**: `tsc --noEmit` exited **0** (0 type errors)\n- **End-to-End Smoke Test**: **3 passed / 3 total** (exercising bin directly + fixture and real catalog paths)\n\n---\n\n### Files Implemented \u0026 Created\n\n1. [`src/catalog.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/catalog.ts) — Dynamic loader consuming `pi-unify-cmd` discovery + config loading without external shims; honors `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR` multi-stage isolation and `~` resolution; provides `grokCommandName`, `slashMarkdown`, `findCommand`, and `loadCatalog`.\n2. [`src/fuzzy.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/fuzzy.ts) — Best-field-max ranking (name × 3, description × 2, body × 1) with boundary, consecutive, and prefix bonuses.\n3. [`src/interpolate.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/interpolate.ts) — Single-pass template placeholder interpolator (`$ARGUMENTS`, `$@`, `{{args}}`, `$1..$9`, `${@:start:len}`) using replacer functions safe from `$\u0026`, `$'`, `` $` ``, and `$$` corruption.\n4. [`src/format.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/format.ts) — Pure formatters for `listText` (`name\\tdesc`), `formatRead` (`# name`, `argument-hint: ...`, content), and `runCmd` invocation rendering.\n5. [`src/sync.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/sync.ts) — Frontmatter markdown sync writer with orphan cleanup, slug collision detection (exit 1), invalid-name stderr warnings, `--dry-run`, and write-only-if-changed mtime protection.\n6. [`src/flags.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/flags.ts) — CLI argument and flag parser supporting `--json`, `--dry-run`, `-h`/`--help`, `-v`/`--version`, `--` end-of-flags delimiter, and arbitrary positional/flag pass-through for `run`.\n7. [`src/verbs.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/verbs.ts) — Single source-of-truth `VERBS` table driving help text, JSON help output, and dispatch routing.\n8. [`src/dispatch.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/dispatch.ts) — Command dispatcher covering all verbs (`list`, `read`, `run`, `search`, `get`, `ping`, `sync`, `help`), structured JSON error formatting on stdout, diagnostics on stderr, and exit code contracts (0 OK, 1 Not Found/Ambiguous/Collision, 2 Usage/Config Error).\n9. [`src/cli.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/cli.ts) \u0026 [`src/index.ts`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/src/index.ts) — CLI entry points and public API barrel exports.\n10. [`README.md`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/cmd-pallet/README.md) — Documentation covering CLI verbs, `--json` mode, trust chain, `cmd-pallet` vs `cmd-palette` distinction, and `run=materialize-not-execute` semantics.\n\n---\n\n### Plan Items \u0026 Gap Analysis\n\n- **Plan Items Covered**: All 30 items from [`cmd-pallet-cli.md`](file:///home/bhd/Documents/Projects/bhd/pi-cmd-palette/flow/plans/cmd-pallet-cli.md) (`repo-exists`, `catalog-reuse`, `verb-list`, `verb-read`, `verb-run`, `verb-aliases`, `verb-ping`, `verb-sync`, `verb-help`, `json-flag`, `tests-pass`, `typecheck-pass`, `smoke-pass`, `local-run`, `readme-parity`, `dep-resolution`, `engines-gate`, `arg-contract`, `interpolate-safe`, `flag-parsing`, `output-contract`, `catalog-env`, `help-safety`, `sync-hygiene`, `smoke-fixture`, `test-isolation`, `read-golden`, `run-docs`, `repo-hygiene`, `path-probe`).\n- **Gaps Found**: **None**. All contracts and hardened gotchas are fully covered and verified.\n\n---\n\n### Commit\n\nCommitted on `main`:\n- `b8a3fd4` — `GREEN: implement cmd-pallet CLI to full test suite` (not pushed).\n","duration_seconds":872.957181193,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":434289,"output_tokens":61203,"thinking_tokens":37101,"cache_read_tokens":8615021,"total_tokens":495492}}
